 "summary": "The module adds genuinely new material: no Legendre L\u00b2 basis exists in Mathlib (only `Polynomial.shiftedLegendre`), TauCeti (only Legendre symbol/elliptic curve), Physlib (only Legendre transform), or EpsilonEridani. It reuses TauCeti's weighted-L\u00b2 bridge and moment-determinacy completeness rather than reproving them, and feeds in the existing `setIntegral_Icc_legendre_mul_legendre` and `degree_legendre`.",
